--
-- All four agree, so the extract is complete and nothing was truncated by the
-- grid's virtualisation. Two columns it cannot carry, because the report does
-- not put them in the table: `owner` (Atsakingas is only a slicer there) and
-- `note`. They arrive with the first edit of each row.
--
-- Run once, after schema.sql. Guarded, because running it twice would double
-- the register and the totals would still look plausible.
